# Per gdn/validation_plan.md §9: raw/ under any attempt directory is
# gitignored — it holds heavyweight per-attempt outputs (SGLang server
# stderr/stdout, .nsys-rep captures) that should not enter git. Small
# evidence (client records JSONL, correctness gate CSVs, summary /
# verdict files) belongs at the attempt root and IS committed.
#
# Recursive glob — matches raw/ at any depth under this directory,
# so multi-cell attempts (e.g. gdn_a0_baseline_.../cell/raw/) are
# covered as well as single-cell attempts (attempt_.../raw/).
**/raw/
